OL,5,G2100 Police: Suspect No.1
OL,6,     FAfter a holiday let agent spots
OL,7,     Fthree unknown men entering her
OL,8,     Fproperty, police pursue the
OL,9,     Fperpetrators, while a search of
OL,10,     Fthe house uncovers sinister
OL,11,     Fevidence of a kidnap plot.
OL,12,G2200 Major Crimes Unit
OL,13,     FIn Dudley, after gunfire rips
OL,14,     Fthrough a young mother's front
OL,15,     Fdoor and a shot strikes her in the
OL,16,     Fhip, the team are tasked with
OL,17,     Fidentifying the perpetrators,
OL,18,     Fleaving no stone unturned.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/6
