OL,5,G2330 Forensics: Murder Scene
OL,6,     FOn New Year's Eve in Swansea, a
OL,7,     Fmass brawl leaves a teenage boy
OL,8,     Ffighting for his life, prompting
OL,9,     Fdetectives to piece together CCTV
OL,10,     Fand social media evidence to find
OL,11,     Fthose responsible.
OL,12,G0015 Forensics: Murder Scene
OL,13,     FA teenager remains critically
OL,14,     Finjured after a mass brawl in
OL,15,     FSwansea. As detectives identify
OL,16,     Fand arrest further suspects, one
OL,17,     Fquestion remains: did they all
OL,18,     Factually commit a crime?
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/6
